The Exa patch README in samples/exa-ai-sdk-patch/ describes a patch against
@exalabs/ai-sdk, which is MIT-licensed. Copyright for the original package
belongs to Exa. The README itself is also MIT-licensed; see
https://gitlab.com/antonyvo/exa-ai-sdk-patch.

The Omni Core documentation in samples/omni-core-docs/ was written against
the Omni Core source, which is released under the MIT license. These pages
are not official Omni Layer documentation.
